    "title": "Country dance competition coming Dec. 6 to Philomath - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brad Fuqua, Philomath News ,\n5 hours ago Winter Wonderdance, a competition hosted by Jamie Lee Dancing, is coming to Marys River Grange Hall from 6-11 p.m. Friday, Dec. 6, organizers announced. The event will feature country swing, line dancing and multiple competition divisions including Jack and Jill country swing, line dance, strictly country swing and line choreography. Competitors and spectators alike are welcome to attend. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
